".claude/docs/tests-summary.md": [
65,
"**Full plan:** `.andromeda/test-plan.md`. Path-scoped rules: `.claude/rules/testing.md`, `.claude/rules/verification-harness.md`.",
66
],
".claude/rules/testing.md": [
113,
"- 2026-11-13: Two more shared helpers stand in `tests/support/`, and a census or root test defines no copy of either: the source masker `source_scan.rs` (`masked` with `Mask::Comments` or `Mask::CommentsAndLiterals`), which only the census binaries take, by `#[path = \"support/source_scan.rs\"]`, so no other binary runs its cases; and `private_dir(path, what)` in `home.rs`, the one test call of `viola_state::fs::create_private_dir`.",
114
],
".claude/rules/verification-harness.md": [
72,
"- 2026-10-20: `target/debug/viola` is a hard link cargo re-points per feature set, so a `fake-agent` build between a live rig's setup and its start swaps the binary under it: read the build's hash right before the start, and restore a ledgered build by `ln -f` from its `target/debug/deps/` artifact.",
73
]
},
